    <panel_attributes>Class diagram generated from the source code.
Shown: fields and public or protected methods.
Omitted: private helpers, constructors, plain getters and
setters, Swing widget fields, private JSON records.
Services use the repositories named in their fields; those
lines, and lines to the domain classes, are not drawn.
Services that publish events hold the EventBus (lines not drawn).
Child entities refer to their Course by courseId.</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes></additional_attributes>
